<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IMC Global &quot;featured stock&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IMC Global &quot;featured stock&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it named IMC Global Inc its &quot;Featured Stock of Week.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Monday, IMC Global and Freeport-McMoRan Inc said they reached a non-binding agreement for a stock swap merger that would leave IMC Global as the surviving entity.</p>
<p>-- IMC Global gained 7/16 to 34-3/16.</p>
</text>
